config AMAZON_MT76X8_MODULES
	tristate "Amazon's MT7668 Wi-Fi and Bluetooth modules"
	depends on MODULES && CFG80211
	help
	  Builds wlan_mt76x8_sdio.ko, wlan_mt76x8_sdio_prealloc.ko and
	  btmtksdio.ko from drivers/amazon for the Echo Dot (3rd gen). Set it
	  to m: LineageOS's build only installs modules when the config has
	  an option set to m.
